WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 39

01:41.260 --> 01:42.630
Even if you're telling the truth,

01:42.650 --> 01:44.130
tell me

01:44.180 --> 01:45.630
how you'll get out of here.

01:45.650 --> 01:47.010
Shen Zhong wouldn't

01:47.010 --> 01:48.680
let me go easily.

01:48.820 --> 01:51.170
I have a subordinate called Wang Qinian.

01:51.650 --> 01:53.170
Wang Qinian?

01:54.010 --> 01:55.310
The clerk of the First Division?

01:55.330 --> 01:56.050
He's already

01:56.050 --> 01:57.680
chosen to work for me.

01:57.900 --> 01:58.450
Before I came here,

01:58.450 --> 02:00.240
I asked him to seek help.

02:01.690 --> 02:03.880
It's more ridiculous.

02:03.900 --> 02:05.750
Here is Beiqi.

02:05.770 --> 02:07.240
Who can you turn to?

02:07.260 --> 02:09.250
Who can match the Embroidered Uniform Guards?

02:10.490 --> 02:11.210
I finally see

02:11.210 --> 02:11.850
why you're

02:11.850 --> 02:13.280
severely tortured.

02:13.340 --> 02:14.600
Mr. Yan,

02:14.620 --> 02:15.290
nobody would like you

02:15.290 --> 02:17.040
because of your character.

02:17.980 --> 02:19.600
Be gentle.

02:19.620 --> 02:20.550
Sorry.

02:20.570 --> 02:22.400
I forgot you're injured.

02:22.420 --> 02:23.600
Besides,

02:23.620 --> 02:25.060
I took back what I said.

02:25.060 --> 02:26.840
Someone does like you.

02:34.340 --> 02:36.400
I've told you.

02:36.730 --> 02:38.680
I got close to you

02:38.700 --> 02:40.620
just to take advantage of you

02:40.620 --> 02:42.250
and find out more military information.

02:42.820 --> 02:44.840
I've never been into you.

02:46.650 --> 02:48.680
Don't talk too much.

02:48.700 --> 02:50.450
You're still weak.

02:51.260 --> 02:53.250
I've been lying to you.

02:54.900 --> 02:56.480
I know.

02:57.140 --> 02:58.810
I tried to hate you,

02:59.060 --> 03:00.970
but I still don't have the heart

03:01.090 --> 03:02.810
to see you be tortured like this.

03:05.060 --> 03:07.040
Stupid woman.

03:09.700 --> 03:11.530
I'll get you a cup of water.

03:21.420 --> 03:23.040
She's not stupid.

03:23.060 --> 03:25.120
She just loves you too much.

03:40.260 --> 03:41.640
Your Excellency.

03:41.820 --> 03:42.630
Are they inside?

03:42.650 --> 03:44.690
Yes. They're surrounded.

03:45.620 --> 03:46.890
Why don't you go in?

03:46.930 --> 03:48.480
Because Lady Shen is inside.

04:04.060 --> 04:06.090
There is no hot water here.

04:06.370 --> 04:08.610
Make do with it.

04:16.930 --> 04:18.440
Your brother and I

04:18.460 --> 04:20.640
will be enemies forever.

04:20.820 --> 04:22.410
You're helping me get out,

04:23.210 --> 04:24.810
but I'm not sure what'll happen in the future.

04:31.770 --> 04:35.040
If you kill my brother someday,

04:35.930 --> 04:38.480
just kill me too.

04:40.700 --> 04:42.400
Lady Shen cares about you so much.

04:42.420 --> 04:44.310
Why are you iron-hearted and ruthless?

04:44.330 --> 04:45.400
And, guys,

04:45.420 --> 04:46.860
can you continue talking

04:46.860 --> 04:47.540
after we get back to the mission?

04:47.540 --> 04:48.850
There is hot water in my place.

04:53.930 --> 04:55.370
Catch me.

04:56.580 --> 04:57.300
Brother,

04:57.300 --> 04:58.490
they said they wouldn't spare my life

04:58.490 --> 05:00.160
unless they escape.

05:23.140 --> 05:24.880
You're muddle-headed.

05:25.980 --> 05:28.440
They are secret agents of the enemy.

05:30.020 --> 05:32.460
I... I was kidnapped.

05:32.460 --> 05:34.480
I'm not an idiot!

05:43.820 --> 05:45.320
Your Excellency Fan.

05:46.890 --> 05:48.630
Well done.

05:48.650 --> 05:50.440
You came in alone.

05:50.460 --> 05:51.300
Aren't you afraid

05:51.300 --> 05:52.760
I'd also kidnap you?

05:55.090 --> 05:56.760
I just gave them an order.

05:57.890 --> 05:59.920
They have to shoot arrows

06:00.170 --> 06:01.720
at all of us

06:01.740 --> 06:03.240
if you threaten me.

06:03.260 --> 06:04.600
Brother!

06:05.540 --> 06:07.750
Your Excellency Shen, you don't have to do that.

06:07.770 --> 06:09.140
You have to hand over Yan Bingyun

06:09.140 --> 06:10.440
to us sooner or later.

06:10.460 --> 06:11.720
Now that I found him,

06:11.740 --> 06:13.480
it's better to let me take him back.

06:14.050 --> 06:15.480
No problem.

06:15.980 --> 06:17.370
As long as he gives me

06:17.370 --> 06:18.630
the list of spies in Shangjing,

06:18.650 --> 06:20.090
he'll be set free immediately.

06:22.700 --> 06:24.640
How about telling him about it?

06:27.650 --> 06:28.920
Okay.

06:39.580 --> 06:41.120
All the ministers and assistant ministers

06:41.140 --> 06:43.120
of the six ministries of Beiqi

06:43.140 --> 06:45.440
are secret agents of Nanqing.

06:46.140 --> 06:48.200
If you kill them,

06:48.650 --> 06:50.870
all will be at peace

06:50.890 --> 06:52.720
and there'll be no spies here.

07:00.090 --> 07:01.400
See?

07:01.420 --> 07:03.480
Did you hear what he said?

07:06.300 --> 07:08.370
I was kidnapped.

07:16.330 --> 07:18.030
Your Excellency Fan, you're free to go.

07:18.050 --> 07:19.140
He has to go with me.

07:19.140 --> 07:20.120
No. Not now.

07:20.140 --> 07:21.570
I'm not asking for your permission.

07:23.490 --> 07:25.370
Then both of you stay.

07:25.980 --> 07:27.250
Guards!

07:32.540 --> 07:34.420
Your Excellency Shen, if you kill me,

07:34.420 --> 07:36.920
aren't you afraid the two countries will go to war again?

07:43.930 --> 07:45.970
Nobody knows you're here.

07:46.700 --> 07:48.030
Your Excellency Fan disappeared suddenly.

07:48.050 --> 07:49.630
We tried our best to look for you,

07:49.650 --> 07:51.150
only to find your body.

07:51.170 --> 07:53.120
I feel deeply grieved.

07:53.140 --> 07:55.150
I'm bound to find the murderer

07:55.170 --> 07:57.320
to avenge your death.

07:59.580 --> 08:00.970
Kidnap me.

08:05.090 --> 08:05.700
Kill him!

08:05.700 --> 08:07.130
Your Excellency!

08:19.770 --> 08:21.420
Guys, hold on.

08:21.420 --> 08:22.970
I've got a helper.

08:36.220 --> 08:37.770
How did you get a helper?

08:37.850 --> 08:39.280
I get well along with people.

08:52.530 --> 08:54.280
Saintess, why are you here?

08:56.490 --> 08:58.080
Now that they found him,

08:58.410 --> 08:59.370
the Embroidered Uniform Guards

08:59.370 --> 09:00.920
lost this round.

09:01.100 --> 09:03.400
Save face and let them go.

09:06.170 --> 09:08.390
It's our own business.

09:08.410 --> 09:10.570
Please stay out of it.

09:12.170 --> 09:14.040
These are not my words.

09:14.290 --> 09:16.080
His Majesty asked you to do that.

09:19.220 --> 09:22.160
I only take orders from the Empress Dowager.

09:25.020 --> 09:27.010
She also said so.

09:39.220 --> 09:40.560
Shall I wait here

09:40.580 --> 09:42.370
so that you can go to the imperial palace to confirm it?

09:44.370 --> 09:45.720
Let them go.

09:46.460 --> 09:48.010
Got it.

10:12.100 --> 10:13.690
Why are you looking at me like that?

10:13.780 --> 10:15.800
The Saintess of Beiqi is your helper.

10:15.820 --> 10:17.080
Do you think I'd buy your story?

10:17.100 --> 10:18.450
Come on.

10:18.530 --> 10:20.650
It's really weird.

10:23.220 --> 10:24.530
Have a good rest.

10:24.530 --> 10:25.920
Don't think too much.

10:43.410 --> 10:44.590
Your Excellency,

10:44.610 --> 10:46.080
I went to Miss Haitang

10:46.100 --> 10:47.560
as you said.

10:47.580 --> 10:48.270
As expected,

10:48.290 --> 10:50.150
you really took him back.

10:50.170 --> 10:53.160
Wang Qinian. It's really you.

10:53.700 --> 10:54.830
Mr. Yan,

10:54.850 --> 10:56.570
I haven't seen you for a long time.

10:56.820 --> 10:58.280
Nanqing won a landslide victory.

10:58.900 --> 11:01.600
You've made great contributions.

11:02.050 --> 11:04.400
Even you gave in to Beiqi?

11:07.100 --> 11:08.350
What does he mean?

11:08.370 --> 11:09.600
Ignore him.

11:09.970 --> 11:11.000
What's most incredible

11:11.020 --> 11:12.560
about this

11:12.580 --> 11:14.100
is the Saintess of Beiqi

11:14.100 --> 11:15.910
helped us out.

11:15.930 --> 11:17.960
I can understand why you're confused.

11:18.050 --> 11:19.640
Actually, the Saintess

11:19.660 --> 11:21.350
didn't aim to help us,

11:21.370 --> 11:24.570
but to help His Excellency Fan.

11:26.530 --> 11:28.690
They work for different countries,

11:29.050 --> 11:32.810
but the two of them have feelings for each other.

11:35.260 --> 11:37.120
Once a woman falls in love,

11:37.140 --> 11:38.610
she'll do something beyond comprehension.

11:38.610 --> 11:39.580
Do you think I can't hear you

11:39.580 --> 11:41.010
because you lower down your voice?

11:42.660 --> 11:44.480
How could they fall in love?

11:45.260 --> 11:46.760
I have to

11:46.780 --> 11:48.260
start the story

11:48.260 --> 11:49.460
from his aphrodisiac.

11:49.460 --> 11:50.600
Speaking of...

11:56.290 --> 11:58.080
I can hear you.

11:58.100 --> 11:59.840
Miss Duoduo,

11:59.970 --> 12:01.330
trust me.

12:01.460 --> 12:02.800
From today on,

12:02.820 --> 12:04.730
I'll keep my mouth shut

12:04.730 --> 12:06.800
and never spill the beans.

12:06.820 --> 12:08.600
You got it wrong.

12:11.530 --> 12:12.580
Miss Duoduo,

12:12.580 --> 12:14.780
I see. I see.

12:14.780 --> 12:17.240
It generated because of the medication,
but it's restrained because of love.

12:17.260 --> 12:18.490
Actually,

12:18.490 --> 12:21.130
it's a beautiful love story.

12:29.820 --> 12:31.520
What a martial arts master!

12:32.660 --> 12:35.570
It's not easy for His Excellency.

12:43.700 --> 12:45.020
How can you do this?

12:45.020 --> 12:46.020
What's wrong with the guy? Shame on him.

12:46.020 --> 12:48.600
He ran away after harassing girls.

12:49.220 --> 12:50.910
Aphrodisiac?

12:50.930 --> 12:52.280
It's a misunderstanding.

13:34.170 --> 13:35.770
We'll go to the back door.

13:50.050 --> 13:50.950
Wang.

13:50.970 --> 13:52.250
Gao.

13:53.140 --> 13:54.830
You're still fighting.

13:54.850 --> 13:56.350
There are too many challengers in a queue.

13:56.370 --> 13:58.330
I've enjoyed myself fighting these days.

13:59.660 --> 14:00.900
Tell His Excellency

14:00.900 --> 14:02.450
I've lost to nobody.

14:04.020 --> 14:05.640
The Saintess drove the cart.

14:05.660 --> 14:07.160
Who's inside?

14:09.340 --> 14:10.480
Come over.

14:18.700 --> 14:20.240
It's His Excellency Fan and Mr. Yan

14:20.260 --> 14:23.330
that are sitting inside.

14:23.530 --> 14:25.010
Is he saved?

14:25.220 --> 14:27.330
Yes, thanks to Miss Haitang.

14:27.460 --> 14:29.210
Really?

14:33.580 --> 14:34.560
As for the relationship

14:34.580 --> 14:36.650
between His Excellency and Miss Haitang,

14:37.220 --> 14:38.650
keep it a secret.

14:39.930 --> 14:42.480
Don't tell anyone about it.

14:46.410 --> 14:47.510
Wang,

14:47.530 --> 14:49.160
please get one more challenger in for me.

14:51.930 --> 14:53.450
He's saved.

15:02.730 --> 15:03.910
-Mr. Yan. -Mr. Yan.

15:03.930 --> 15:05.650
Mr. Yan.

15:15.170 --> 15:17.270
That must be hard. You must've suffered a lot.

15:17.290 --> 15:18.100
Yeah.

15:18.100 --> 15:19.530
That's enough.

15:19.530 --> 15:21.140
He's injured.

15:21.140 --> 15:22.290
Take him to my room and let him have a good rest.

15:22.290 --> 15:23.510
You can talk to him later.

15:23.530 --> 15:24.410
Go.

15:24.410 --> 15:27.480
Okay. Support Mr. Yan.

15:27.820 --> 15:29.130
Gao!

15:32.100 --> 15:32.580
Be careful.

15:32.580 --> 15:33.660
Mr. Yan,

15:33.660 --> 15:35.910
did they cruelly torture you?

15:35.930 --> 15:38.280
Have a good rest now that you're back.

15:49.370 --> 15:51.210
Mind your step.

15:58.260 --> 16:00.330
Thank you, Saintess.

16:02.370 --> 16:04.350
Why did you let Wang Qinian come to me?

16:04.370 --> 16:05.650
To save us.

16:07.370 --> 16:08.580
What if I hadn't shown up?

16:08.580 --> 16:10.370
But you did.

16:10.930 --> 16:12.830
It's because His Majesty asked me to do that.

16:12.850 --> 16:14.570
Please convey my thanks to him.

16:14.970 --> 16:16.680
He'll see you in a few days.

16:16.700 --> 16:18.480
Gao, spare no effort.

16:19.260 --> 16:20.720
For what?

16:20.930 --> 16:22.600
To talk about killing Shen Zhong.

16:23.460 --> 16:25.150
Why?

16:25.170 --> 16:26.910
Without his verbal instructions,

16:26.930 --> 16:28.910
you couldn't have saved Yan Bingyun.

16:28.930 --> 16:29.730
But I have

16:29.730 --> 16:31.440
taken him back.

16:31.460 --> 16:33.580
I want nothing nowadays.

16:33.580 --> 16:35.440
Why do I have to kill Shen Zhong?

16:35.460 --> 16:36.170
Do you always

16:36.170 --> 16:37.720
act shamelessly?

16:38.020 --> 16:39.690
Anyway, I have to thank you.

16:41.020 --> 16:42.920
I can't believe you said that.

16:43.290 --> 16:44.830
It turns out you'd also lose your temper from embarrassment.

16:44.850 --> 16:46.960
What are you talking about?

16:47.260 --> 16:48.350
I'll teach Wang Qinian a lesson

16:48.370 --> 16:49.720
and stop him talking nonsense again.

16:50.580 --> 16:51.590
You're birds of a feather.

16:51.610 --> 16:52.710
We're not.

16:52.730 --> 16:53.970
I can't quite follow

16:53.970 --> 16:55.280
Wang Qinian's brain circuits.

16:56.930 --> 16:59.600
What's "brain circuits"?

16:59.930 --> 17:01.650
It means mind and thoughts.

17:06.130 --> 17:08.320
I'm leaving. Just wait to be called in.

17:08.980 --> 17:10.320
Oh.

17:10.410 --> 17:12.380
My senior fellow apprentice is coming here in a few days.

17:12.380 --> 17:13.960
You'd better not wander around.

17:16.220 --> 17:19.600
Is he dangerous?

17:20.290 --> 17:21.480
Besides my master,

17:21.500 --> 17:23.480
he's the number one martial arts master in Beiqi.

17:23.500 --> 17:24.840
He's called Langtao.

18:01.580 --> 18:03.930
Sugar-coated haws!

18:04.250 --> 18:06.440
Knickknacks!

18:32.440 --> 18:33.740
=Langtao, first apprentice of Great Master Ku He=

18:33.740 --> 18:35.120
=Langtao, first apprentice of Great Master Ku He=
What's wrong with him?

18:35.120 --> 18:36.200
What's wrong with him?

18:41.890 --> 18:42.580
Blood!

18:42.580 --> 18:43.620
He's bleeding.

18:43.620 --> 18:45.130
He's killed.

18:46.770 --> 18:48.510
Most of the officials here

18:48.530 --> 18:50.480
are from Court of State Ceremonials.

18:52.220 --> 18:53.480
We're a mission.

18:53.500 --> 18:55.440
Of course it's mainly composed
of staff of Court of State Ceremonials.

18:55.890 --> 18:57.410
Are you really the envoy?

18:58.100 --> 18:59.600
Definitely.

19:00.130 --> 19:01.980
Unbelievable. Beiqi even agreed to set me free.

19:01.980 --> 19:04.290
We exchanged someone else for you through negotiations.

19:04.860 --> 19:06.080
Who?

19:07.530 --> 19:08.720
Xiao En.

19:08.740 --> 19:10.560
You exchanged Xiao En for me?

19:11.740 --> 19:13.080
Idiot!

19:16.380 --> 19:16.890
Is Xiao En

19:16.890 --> 19:18.530
still under control?

19:20.290 --> 19:22.110
We exchanged him for you,

19:22.130 --> 19:24.680
so we handed him over to Shen Zhong.

19:25.340 --> 19:26.220
Did you get the secret

19:26.220 --> 19:27.680
out of him?

19:27.890 --> 19:29.170
No.

19:29.380 --> 19:30.990
Do you know who Xiao En is?

19:31.010 --> 19:31.870
Yeah.

19:31.890 --> 19:34.030
Then why did you let him come back to Beiqi?

19:34.050 --> 19:35.050
To get you back.

19:35.050 --> 19:36.390
I just told you.

19:36.410 --> 19:38.270
Just let me die.

19:38.290 --> 19:39.890
How can you lay by trouble for the future

19:39.890 --> 19:41.480
because of me?

19:41.860 --> 19:43.530
Don't you want to live?

19:43.930 --> 19:45.390
Since I joined the Investigator's Office,

19:45.410 --> 19:46.680
I've known

19:46.700 --> 19:49.410
I may die anytime for the national interest.

19:50.500 --> 19:52.200
Which idiot made the decision?

19:56.100 --> 19:58.440
His Majesty and Head Chen.

20:03.250 --> 20:04.800
His Majesty also said

20:04.820 --> 20:07.650
Xiao En is old but you're young,

20:07.770 --> 20:08.910
so it's a good deal

20:08.930 --> 20:10.680
for Nanqing.

20:10.700 --> 20:12.050
Sit here.

20:14.820 --> 20:16.230
But His Majesty did ask me to

20:16.250 --> 20:18.290
kill Xiao En on the way.

20:18.770 --> 20:19.630
In this case,

20:19.650 --> 20:21.130
why didn't you do it?

20:21.770 --> 20:22.890
He's under control of Shen Zhong.

20:22.890 --> 20:24.200
How can I do it?

20:24.220 --> 20:25.740
The Investigator's Office will do anything it's ordered to

20:25.740 --> 20:27.250
no matter how difficult it is.

20:29.410 --> 20:30.630
Listen to me.

20:30.650 --> 20:32.050
Shen Zhong is quite cruel

20:32.050 --> 20:33.720
to Xiao En.

20:33.740 --> 20:35.220
They're not in the same camp.

20:35.220 --> 20:36.220
Xiao En

20:36.220 --> 20:38.250
couldn't have a chance to make trouble.

20:38.340 --> 20:39.860
Now that His Majesty asked us to kill him,

20:39.860 --> 20:41.720
we have to do it.

20:42.170 --> 20:43.010
Here is Shangjing.

20:43.010 --> 20:45.150
It's already risky to save you.

20:45.170 --> 20:46.960
Do you want to disobey His Majesty's order?

20:46.980 --> 20:48.220
I have no choice. I just can't do it.

20:48.220 --> 20:49.530
How about you doing it?

20:52.100 --> 20:53.840
Where are you going? What do you want to do?

20:53.860 --> 20:55.320
I'm going to kill Xiao En.

20:55.890 --> 20:57.100
Are you crazy?

20:57.100 --> 20:59.030
How can you do it like this?

20:59.050 --> 21:00.390
It doesn't matter if I can do it.

21:00.410 --> 21:02.150
Someone has to carry out the orders.

21:02.170 --> 21:03.410
But if you go out like this,

21:03.410 --> 21:04.910
you'll die before you find Xiao En.

21:04.930 --> 21:06.220
I am already dead

21:06.220 --> 21:07.750
when I was arrested.

21:07.770 --> 21:08.910
Why are you taking it so lightly?

21:08.930 --> 21:11.030
Have you thought about your parents?

21:11.050 --> 21:12.960
It's all for the sake of Nanqing.

21:18.100 --> 21:19.600
For the sake of Nanqing, right?

21:19.890 --> 21:21.500
Do you know what a high price

21:21.500 --> 21:23.170
Nanqing paid to save you?

21:25.620 --> 21:26.930
How dare you

21:26.930 --> 21:28.100
try to let yourself

21:28.100 --> 21:29.840
be killed here?

21:30.460 --> 21:31.620
His Majesty ordered you

21:31.620 --> 21:33.980
to go back to Nanqing safe and sound.

21:33.980 --> 21:35.250
If you die like that,

21:35.250 --> 21:36.800
both of us will be betrayers of Nanqing.

21:36.820 --> 21:39.010
No. You'll be a betrayer.

21:39.410 --> 21:41.080
You'll be a betrayer!

21:46.410 --> 21:47.960
It's for the sake of Nanqing.

21:47.980 --> 21:49.720
For the sake of Nanqing.

21:49.740 --> 21:51.840
Even if it's for the sake of Nanqing,

21:52.050 --> 21:52.820
we shouldn't

21:52.820 --> 21:55.290
take our lives lightly.

21:55.740 --> 21:58.370
You can do something for Nanqing in another way.

22:00.460 --> 22:01.600
How about like this?

22:01.620 --> 22:02.930
I promise you.

22:03.250 --> 22:04.620
I'd find a chance

22:04.620 --> 22:06.230
to kill Xiao En.

22:06.250 --> 22:07.600
Besides,

22:07.620 --> 22:08.340
Shen Zhong is

22:08.340 --> 22:11.030
Commander-in-chief of the Embroidered Uniform Guards.

22:11.050 --> 22:12.630
Let's also kill him

22:12.650 --> 22:14.440
and make Beiqi fall into a state of chaos.

22:14.460 --> 22:16.010
What do you think?

22:16.740 --> 22:18.680
How will you kill Shen Zhong?

22:19.250 --> 22:20.720
To cooperate with others.

22:21.170 --> 22:23.170
Will Haitang join hands with you to kill their official

22:23.170 --> 22:25.270
because she loves you?

22:25.290 --> 22:26.460
Come on.

22:26.460 --> 22:28.370
I'm going to join hands with the little emperor.

22:32.340 --> 22:33.390
Does the emperor of Beiqi

22:33.410 --> 22:36.250
plan to root out the Empress Dowager's
underlings and seize power?

22:38.010 --> 22:40.080
You prove yourself to be an experienced spy.

22:40.100 --> 22:42.440
You're thinking quickly.

22:42.700 --> 22:44.360
Tell me everything that's happened

22:44.380 --> 22:46.080
since you came here.

22:46.250 --> 22:47.320
No problem.

22:47.340 --> 22:49.440
Take off your clothes and lie down.

22:53.770 --> 22:55.600
I'll apply medicine to your wounds.

22:56.460 --> 22:58.480
Why is Shen Zhong anxious to see me?

22:58.500 --> 22:59.390
What's the matter?

22:59.410 --> 23:01.390
He didn't tell me about it.

23:01.410 --> 23:02.890
Is Langtao back to Shangjing?

23:03.220 --> 23:04.390
I don't know.

23:04.410 --> 23:05.390
Show me the way.

23:05.410 --> 23:06.650
Got it.

23:21.460 --> 23:23.200
Shout if it hurts.

23:23.220 --> 23:24.990
Hearing what you said,

23:25.010 --> 23:27.800
I think there're several things that don't make sense.

23:27.820 --> 23:29.800
Are you still thinking about that?

23:32.460 --> 23:33.800
Xiao En had a chance

23:33.820 --> 23:35.930
to kill you on the way.

23:36.500 --> 23:37.960
Why didn't he do it?

23:38.380 --> 23:39.800
I don't know, either.

23:40.460 --> 23:42.250
I remember

23:42.530 --> 23:44.530
he mentioned Danzhou specially,

23:45.130 --> 23:46.170
so I told him

23:46.170 --> 23:47.800
I was brought up there.

23:48.700 --> 23:49.960
And then?

23:50.380 --> 23:51.800
He never mentioned it again.

23:51.820 --> 23:53.870
If Xiao En is interested in Danzhou,

23:53.890 --> 23:55.720
why didn't he make detailed inquiries?

23:56.130 --> 23:57.890
How do I know that?

24:00.930 --> 24:02.840
When you go back, remember to tell Head Chen

24:03.220 --> 24:04.990
Xiao En's secrets

24:05.010 --> 24:07.010
may have something to do with Danzhou.

24:07.050 --> 24:08.460
Focus on getting yourself better,

24:08.460 --> 24:10.200
or you can't go back.

24:10.290 --> 24:11.990
Let's talk about it later.

24:12.010 --> 24:13.010
Now tell me something about He Daoren.

24:13.010 --> 24:13.740
I also didn't expect

24:13.740 --> 24:16.010
Head Chen even bought over a Ninth Dan swordsman.

24:16.650 --> 24:17.410
Has He Daoren

24:17.410 --> 24:18.680
ever contacted you?

24:18.930 --> 24:20.200
No.

24:21.740 --> 24:23.770
Maybe Head Chen bought over He Daoren

24:23.860 --> 24:26.080
just to give you a hand,

24:28.010 --> 24:29.890
but you got him into big trouble.

24:32.010 --> 24:34.050
Is that in your imagination?

24:35.130 --> 24:35.980
Because of the excuse

24:35.980 --> 24:37.560
he used to cheat Shen Zheng,

24:37.860 --> 24:39.840
he'll be killed.

24:42.380 --> 24:43.680
Fan Xian,

24:44.580 --> 24:46.600
you underestimated Shen Zhong.

25:00.890 --> 25:03.010
Your Excellency, Mr. He is here.

25:22.340 --> 25:25.600
Your Excellency Shen, I wonder what's worrying you.

25:25.620 --> 25:27.050
Two things.

25:28.410 --> 25:29.840
One

25:30.580 --> 25:32.390
is about Yan Bingyun of course.

25:32.410 --> 25:34.360
Your Excellency Shen, don't need to blame yourself.

25:34.380 --> 25:37.250
He'll be set free sooner or later.

25:39.130 --> 25:41.010
It's all my sister's fault.

25:41.410 --> 25:44.560
She's really muddleheaded.

25:44.930 --> 25:46.630
She's young.

25:46.650 --> 25:47.650
A girl at her age

25:47.650 --> 25:49.080
usually focuses on love.

25:49.580 --> 25:51.650
I'm ashamed of her doing that.

25:53.410 --> 25:54.980
She must've been laughed at.

25:54.980 --> 25:56.460
I wonder what's the other thing

25:56.460 --> 25:59.410
that worries you.

26:13.980 --> 26:16.890
Of course it's something about you.

26:17.220 --> 26:18.720
Why did you say that?

26:19.250 --> 26:22.440
As a Ninth Dan martial arts master in Shangjing,

26:22.460 --> 26:25.010
you failed to keep Fan Xian under watch.

26:25.650 --> 26:28.200
It's really weird.

26:28.930 --> 26:30.290
As I said,

26:30.380 --> 26:31.530
someone wearing a mask

26:31.530 --> 26:33.050
stopped me that day.

26:33.170 --> 26:34.740
Didn't you also suspect

26:34.740 --> 26:37.440
it's Shangshan Hu?

26:42.500 --> 26:43.600
I...

26:43.620 --> 26:46.650
I just tried to give you an out.

26:47.250 --> 26:49.340
That guy's timing

26:49.340 --> 26:51.050
was perfect.

26:51.380 --> 26:54.320
It means he had kept in contact with Fan Xian.

26:55.050 --> 26:55.860
But since Fan Xian

26:55.860 --> 26:57.440
came to Shangjing,

26:57.930 --> 27:00.250
he's always been monitored.

27:00.530 --> 27:01.890
Mr. He,

27:02.410 --> 27:04.380
how do you think he managed to

27:04.380 --> 27:06.440
communicate with Shangshan Hu?

27:07.580 --> 27:09.750
Your Excellency Shen, what do you mean?

27:09.770 --> 27:11.560
That guy appeared at the perfect time.

27:11.580 --> 27:13.170
It was really weird.

27:13.290 --> 27:15.230
What if there was no such a person at all?

27:15.250 --> 27:15.890
What if

27:15.890 --> 27:16.890
it was a lie you made up

27:16.890 --> 27:19.290
and it's you that let Fan Xian go?

27:19.530 --> 27:21.010
Are you suspicious of me?

27:21.050 --> 27:22.440
Yes.

27:22.890 --> 27:24.150
In this case,

27:24.170 --> 27:27.170
why didn't you put your cards on the table last time?

27:33.740 --> 27:35.910
You're a Ninth Dan martial arts master.

27:35.930 --> 27:37.480
In case we fell out,

27:37.770 --> 27:40.870
I was not sure if I could defeat you.

27:40.890 --> 27:42.110
So,

27:42.130 --> 27:43.960
are you sure you can do it this time?

28:04.650 --> 28:06.290
Langtao.

28:07.890 --> 28:09.680
You'd better lie down and have a rest.

28:11.220 --> 28:12.720
Now that you asked He Daoren to do that,

28:12.740 --> 28:15.130
Shen Zhong is bound to suspect him.

28:15.890 --> 28:17.290
Just because I have no contact

28:17.290 --> 28:18.510
with Shangshan Hu?

28:18.530 --> 28:20.030
Shen Zhong is suspicious.

28:20.050 --> 28:22.290
One loophole is enough.

28:22.460 --> 28:23.720
Loophole?

28:24.980 --> 28:26.250
Come in.

28:26.340 --> 28:28.010
Your Excellency, Tan Wu...

28:30.620 --> 28:32.410
I want to drink some water.

28:33.250 --> 28:34.560
Have you finished fighting?

28:34.580 --> 28:36.750
No. There is still a long queue.

28:36.770 --> 28:38.030
I have a tight schedule.

28:38.050 --> 28:39.650
They're all here to challenge you.

28:40.100 --> 28:41.320
I appreciate your hard work.

28:41.340 --> 28:43.200
I've enjoyed myself. I don't think it's tiring.

28:45.580 --> 28:47.100
It's alright. If you have something to report,

28:47.100 --> 28:48.840
you can say it in the presence of Mr. Yan.

28:50.460 --> 28:51.680
Shangshan Hu's subordinate asked me

28:51.700 --> 28:53.290
when we'll take action.

28:54.130 --> 28:55.200
Tell him

28:55.220 --> 28:56.960
I'll give him a reply in two or three days.

28:56.980 --> 28:59.010
Okay. I'll do that.

29:00.380 --> 29:01.960
I'll leave you alone.

29:11.100 --> 29:12.960
Have you kept in contact with Shangshan Hu?

29:12.980 --> 29:14.010
He Daoren

29:14.010 --> 29:15.150
works for Head Chen.

29:15.170 --> 29:17.170
I won't let him lose his life for nothing.

29:17.220 --> 29:18.600
With eyes watching,

29:18.620 --> 29:19.820
how did Shangshan Hu

29:19.820 --> 29:20.870
make contact with you?

29:20.890 --> 29:22.750
Men can communicate with each other

29:22.770 --> 29:24.720
through fighting.

29:37.460 --> 29:38.500
Sorry for having kept you waiting.

29:38.520 --> 29:39.410
=Tan Wu, Shangshan Hu's Deputy General of Beiqi=

29:39.410 --> 29:40.380
It's okay.
=Tan Wu, Shangshan Hu's Deputy General of Beiqi=

29:40.380 --> 29:41.460
=Tan Wu, Shangshan Hu's Deputy General of Beiqi=

29:44.460 --> 29:45.800
Let's get started!

30:10.010 --> 30:10.770
You'll get a reply

30:10.770 --> 30:12.130
in two or three days.

30:14.460 --> 30:15.600
I'll report it to Grand General

30:15.620 --> 30:17.080
and wait for the good news.

30:37.500 --> 30:39.680
My master had an estimate of my capabilities.

30:40.130 --> 30:41.770
Master Ku He?

30:43.500 --> 30:44.960
Master said

30:45.170 --> 30:47.170
among all Ninth Dan martial arts masters,

30:47.340 --> 30:49.170
I'm ranked the third.

30:57.170 --> 30:58.630
The top two

30:58.650 --> 31:00.530
are not in Beiqi.

31:02.650 --> 31:04.360
If you fight me,

31:04.380 --> 31:05.960
you'll definitely die.

31:07.220 --> 31:09.440
I've never betrayed Beiqi.

31:11.530 --> 31:13.600
Then put down your sword.

31:13.890 --> 31:15.650
Let's have a talk.

31:20.170 --> 31:21.720
If I put down my sword,

31:21.740 --> 31:23.890
I'd place myself at the mercy of you.

31:41.170 --> 31:42.320
Your Excellency!

31:44.290 --> 31:44.980
We found that

31:44.980 --> 31:46.840
Shangshan Hu's subordinate Tan Wu

31:46.860 --> 31:48.800
is fighting at the gate of the mission's residence.

31:53.130 --> 31:55.080
Why didn't you report it until today?

31:55.100 --> 31:56.680
He went there on the first day.

31:56.700 --> 31:58.360
Then he never showed up again.

31:58.380 --> 31:58.890
The guys who kept the mission under watch

31:58.890 --> 32:00.170
thought he was there just to fight,

32:00.170 --> 32:01.480
so they didn't report it.

32:01.500 --> 32:04.370
But Tan Wu showed up again today.

32:05.010 --> 32:06.770
Those guys

32:06.770 --> 32:08.200
neglected their duties.

32:08.220 --> 32:09.340
Punish them at hard labor for a year.

32:09.340 --> 32:10.440
Got it.

32:18.340 --> 32:19.820
So, Shangshan Hu

32:19.820 --> 32:21.500
really has kept in contact

32:21.500 --> 32:23.600
with Fan Xian.

32:25.620 --> 32:26.870
It may not be true.

32:26.890 --> 32:28.010
Maybe

32:28.010 --> 32:31.050
it's a trap set by me.

32:32.410 --> 32:34.930
I thought too much.

32:35.380 --> 32:36.960
Mr. He, please forgive me.

32:40.700 --> 32:43.080
It's all for the sake of Beiqi.

32:43.340 --> 32:45.440
If you're angry,

32:45.460 --> 32:47.440
you can stab me

32:47.460 --> 32:48.890
to vent your anger.

33:06.580 --> 33:08.510
The timing is perfect.

33:08.530 --> 33:10.620
Why did Tan Wu

33:10.620 --> 33:12.080
reappear today?

33:12.100 --> 33:12.980
He's here to discuss

33:12.980 --> 33:14.360
the cooperation.

33:14.380 --> 33:15.720
What will you do?

33:16.860 --> 33:18.320
To save Xiao En.

33:19.050 --> 33:20.930
Why do they want to cooperate with you?

33:21.100 --> 33:22.740
Shangshan Hu doesn't know

33:22.740 --> 33:24.390
where Xiao En is imprisoned.

33:24.410 --> 33:25.770
Our cooperation is based on the premise

33:25.770 --> 33:27.930
I find out where Xiao En is.

33:28.130 --> 33:29.960
Why does he believe you can do that?

33:29.980 --> 33:32.010
He didn't at the beginning,

33:32.170 --> 33:33.840
so I asked him to wait.

33:33.860 --> 33:35.440
If I save you,

33:36.050 --> 33:37.800
my capabilities will be proven.

33:39.700 --> 33:41.800
So, you asked He Daoren to tell lies

33:41.820 --> 33:43.370
to save me.

33:43.740 --> 33:45.200
When you do that,

33:45.220 --> 33:47.080
Tan Wu would show up,

33:47.290 --> 33:48.680
which in turn

33:48.700 --> 33:49.290
would spare He Daoren

33:49.290 --> 33:51.230
from suspicion.

33:51.250 --> 33:54.770
These things linked with each other
and interacted as both cause and effect.

33:55.930 --> 33:58.050
You're really capable.

33:58.100 --> 34:00.320
You can say such words more often.

34:02.650 --> 34:04.650
So, you know where Xiao En is?

34:05.890 --> 34:06.990
No.

34:07.010 --> 34:07.920
Can you find him?

34:07.940 --> 34:09.360
No.

34:09.380 --> 34:11.050
I found you

34:11.050 --> 34:13.410
just because Lady Shen loves you.

34:14.620 --> 34:16.490
I don't love her.

34:16.620 --> 34:17.600
I got closer to her

34:17.620 --> 34:18.770
just to collect military information.

34:18.770 --> 34:19.530
Enough. Enough.

34:19.530 --> 34:21.170
You don't need to explain it to me.

34:23.660 --> 34:25.600
Now that you can't find Xiao En,

34:25.730 --> 34:27.360
you're deceiving Shangshan Hu.

34:27.380 --> 34:28.600
No.

34:28.660 --> 34:29.860
I sincerely want to cooperate with him

34:29.860 --> 34:32.190
and get Xiao En out.

34:32.210 --> 34:33.920
Don't you want to kill Xiao En?

34:33.940 --> 34:36.320
You can't do that if we can't get him out.

34:37.490 --> 34:40.240
How will you get him out if you can't find him?

34:40.970 --> 34:42.770
Haitang Duoduo told me

34:42.770 --> 34:45.000
the little emperor of Beiqi wants to see me.

34:45.050 --> 34:46.800
What on earth do you want to do?

34:50.010 --> 34:52.190
It doesn't matter what I want to do.

34:52.210 --> 34:54.320
It matters what relevant parties of Beiqi

34:54.340 --> 34:55.890
want to do.

34:56.690 --> 34:58.840
I'm just helping them

34:58.900 --> 35:02.690
achieve their goals respectively.

35:13.340 --> 35:15.380
As the Saintess, you're showing me the way personally.

35:15.380 --> 35:17.600
I feel flattered.

35:20.250 --> 35:21.470
Or are you

35:21.490 --> 35:23.360
under the Empress Dowager's order

35:23.380 --> 35:25.160
to keep watch on me and the little emperor?

35:25.180 --> 35:26.470
You're talkative.

35:26.490 --> 35:27.530
I can't believe

35:27.530 --> 35:29.280
you're a double agent.

35:29.450 --> 35:31.640
Come on. Is it related to you?

35:31.660 --> 35:32.340
No.

35:32.340 --> 35:34.210
I'm already engaged.

35:48.450 --> 35:49.800
You're the Saintess.

35:49.820 --> 35:51.690
Can't you be more like a lady?

36:06.580 --> 36:08.760
Your Majesty, here I am.

36:10.140 --> 36:11.800
Good job.

36:15.050 --> 36:17.730
Shen Zhong took strict precautions against you,

36:17.770 --> 36:18.860
but you really managed to

36:18.860 --> 36:20.210
find Yan Bingyun's whereabouts.

36:20.250 --> 36:21.530
Your thought and skills

36:21.530 --> 36:23.230
are outstanding.

36:23.250 --> 36:24.650
I'm just lucky.

36:25.380 --> 36:27.050
If Shen Zhong didn't have a sister,

36:27.050 --> 36:28.400
how would you find Yan Bingyun?

36:28.420 --> 36:30.520
Of course to turn to you.

36:30.580 --> 36:32.560
How do you know if I'd help you out?

36:32.580 --> 36:33.770
You want me

36:33.770 --> 36:35.450
to kill Shen Zhong.

36:35.770 --> 36:37.600
We should help each other.

36:37.620 --> 36:39.240
It'll be a story on everyone's lips.

36:40.450 --> 36:43.370
So, do you agree to kill Shen Zhong?

36:45.420 --> 36:46.970
I have a condition.

36:51.580 --> 36:52.890
Go ahead.

36:54.010 --> 36:55.750
I want to know where Xiao En is.

36:55.770 --> 36:57.760
And then?

36:57.860 --> 36:59.240
To get him out.

37:00.100 --> 37:01.160
How?

37:01.180 --> 37:02.880
By cooperating with Shangshan Hu.

37:02.900 --> 37:04.990
Xiao En was a high-ranking official of Beiqi.

37:05.010 --> 37:05.690
Exactly.

37:05.690 --> 37:07.470
Shangshan Hu is a famous general of Beiqi.

37:07.490 --> 37:08.890
He's important.

37:09.660 --> 37:11.050
You want to collude with our general

37:11.050 --> 37:12.890
to break into a jail and rescue a prisoner.

37:12.940 --> 37:14.230
And you're telling His Majesty about it.

37:14.250 --> 37:15.800
I'm not just telling him.

37:15.820 --> 37:17.560
I'm turning to him.

37:17.620 --> 37:18.950
Your Majesty, you tell me where Xiao En is.

37:18.970 --> 37:20.320
Shangshan Hu and I will get him out.

37:20.340 --> 37:21.840
We can be considered partners.

37:22.010 --> 37:23.650
You want to break into a prison of Beiqi

37:24.140 --> 37:25.950
and conspire with the emperor of Beiqi?

37:25.970 --> 37:26.730
As I said,

37:26.730 --> 37:28.210
we should help each other.

37:29.450 --> 37:30.660
As I said,

37:30.660 --> 37:32.240
he's extremely daring.

37:32.690 --> 37:34.840
Mr. Fan, tell me

37:34.860 --> 37:37.040
why I should conspire with you.

37:39.690 --> 37:40.970
Your Majesty,

37:41.250 --> 37:42.920
what will Shen Zhong do

37:42.940 --> 37:44.320
if Shangshan Hu tries to save Xiao En?

37:44.340 --> 37:45.510
He'll do all he can to stop it.

37:45.530 --> 37:46.690
Who is better at martial arts,

37:46.690 --> 37:47.860
Shen Zhong or Shangshan Hu?

37:47.860 --> 37:49.380
Shen Zhong is no match for Shangshan Hu.

37:49.380 --> 37:50.100
Okay.

37:50.100 --> 37:51.380
While Shangshan Hu wants to save Xiao En,

37:51.380 --> 37:52.530
Shen Zhong is bound to stop it.

37:52.530 --> 37:54.600
In this case, they're sure to fight.

37:54.820 --> 37:56.290
Do you want to see Shen Zhong be killed

37:56.290 --> 37:57.320
by Shangshan Hu?

37:57.340 --> 37:59.320
Yes, for your sake.

37:59.340 --> 38:00.970
If Shen Zhong is killed,

38:00.970 --> 38:02.420
Shangshan Hu deserves the harshest punishment.

38:02.420 --> 38:03.530
So, you can arrest him

38:03.530 --> 38:04.800
and execute him later.

38:05.420 --> 38:06.530
You want to kill

38:06.530 --> 38:09.130
both Shen Zhong and Shangshan Hu.

38:09.380 --> 38:10.420
Are you aiming to

38:10.420 --> 38:12.520
weaken Beiqi?

38:14.940 --> 38:16.580
Shangshan Hu doesn't take orders from you

38:16.580 --> 38:18.400
or from the Empress Dowager.

38:18.420 --> 38:20.380
And he enjoys an awe-inspiring reputation in the military.

38:20.380 --> 38:22.190
Can you set your mind at rest

38:22.210 --> 38:23.800
if he's alive?

38:24.900 --> 38:26.890
Mr. Fan, you're really brainy.

38:27.690 --> 38:29.040
I kind of agree.

38:29.210 --> 38:30.970
What if Shen Zhong survives?

38:30.970 --> 38:32.400
Even if he's not killed,

38:32.420 --> 38:34.840
he's neglected his duties because Xiao En is saved.

38:34.860 --> 38:35.420
By then,

38:35.420 --> 38:36.990
you can punish him and remove him from office.

38:37.010 --> 38:38.120
In that case,

38:38.140 --> 38:39.970
he can be killed any time.

38:41.690 --> 38:42.580
You've considered

38:42.580 --> 38:44.280
everything about it.

38:44.940 --> 38:46.290
It took me lots of efforts

38:46.290 --> 38:47.650
to think of these ideas.

38:47.770 --> 38:49.650
It's for the sake of you.

38:50.100 --> 38:52.010
You did all this

38:52.010 --> 38:53.400
for the sake of me?

38:53.420 --> 38:54.760
Or else?

39:00.820 --> 39:01.750
Your Majesty,

39:01.770 --> 39:04.240
you haven't told me where Xiao En is.

39:07.100 --> 39:08.730
Is he going to the bathroom?

39:09.940 --> 39:11.770
Xiao En is imprisoned out of town.

39:11.770 --> 39:12.860
I'll tell you

39:12.860 --> 39:14.890
the specific place when I see you out.

39:16.290 --> 39:17.670
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

39:17.690 --> 39:20.280
We're cooperation partners!

39:28.050 --> 39:30.750
Did Fan Xian go to see Shangshan Hu?

39:30.770 --> 39:32.130
Exactly.

39:33.180 --> 39:34.120
Not in a sneaky way?

39:34.140 --> 39:36.600
No. He was fully at ease.

39:38.100 --> 39:40.130
Where did he go before that?

39:40.340 --> 39:42.230
The imperial palace. He was called in by His Majesty.

39:42.250 --> 39:43.690
Called in again?

39:44.210 --> 39:45.190
What did they talk about?

39:45.210 --> 39:46.950
According to a message from the Empress Dowager,

39:46.970 --> 39:48.920
the Saintess stayed with them.

39:48.940 --> 39:50.670
They just talked about some poems and essays

39:50.690 --> 39:52.370
instead of anything else.

39:56.940 --> 39:59.650
Why did Fan Xian go to see Shangshan Hu?

39:59.730 --> 40:02.970
And he did it openly, not afraid of being seen.

40:31.730 --> 40:32.770
You came to see me

40:32.770 --> 40:34.650
openly like this.

40:35.340 --> 40:37.160
Shen Zhong is bound to find it out.

40:37.180 --> 40:38.900
Won't he find it out

40:38.900 --> 40:40.320
if we meet in a concealed place?

40:40.340 --> 40:42.360
Even if I choose a concealed place,

40:42.380 --> 40:43.900
your subordinate Tan Wu

40:43.900 --> 40:45.990
showed up twice at the gate of the mission's residence.

40:46.010 --> 40:47.800
Do you think Shen Zhong wouldn't notice it?

40:47.820 --> 40:49.170
Besides,

40:50.140 --> 40:52.270
even if I don't come to see you,

40:52.290 --> 40:53.420
will Shen Zhong stop

40:53.420 --> 40:54.890
taking strict precautions against you?

40:56.050 --> 40:58.120
Now that you dare to see me,

40:58.140 --> 40:59.380
I don't think you're afraid of

40:59.380 --> 41:00.600
Shen Zhong.

41:00.620 --> 41:02.130
Am I right?

41:28.940 --> 41:30.930
I really want to kill you.

41:31.210 --> 41:32.690
Why do you say that?

41:33.290 --> 41:34.890
Judging from your style,

41:35.250 --> 41:37.120
you'll be a formidable enemy of Beiqi.

41:37.140 --> 41:38.640
How will you save Master Xiao En

41:38.660 --> 41:40.430
if I'm dead?

41:40.450 --> 41:41.970
Have you found out where he is?

41:41.970 --> 41:43.320
Exactly.

41:43.340 --> 41:44.320
How did you find it out?

41:44.340 --> 41:45.360
It's not important.

41:45.380 --> 41:46.270
Where is he?

41:46.290 --> 41:47.050
I think

41:47.050 --> 41:48.320
it's better to figure out a plan first.

41:48.340 --> 41:50.730
We shouldn't do it hastily, right?

41:52.100 --> 41:53.560
What do you want to do?

41:54.210 --> 41:55.490
Shen Zhong is so cruel

41:55.490 --> 41:56.840
to Master Xiao.

41:57.530 --> 41:59.760
Do you want to take revenge?

42:01.900 --> 42:03.370
Go ahead.

42:08.420 --> 42:10.130
Actually, it's easy to guess.

42:10.860 --> 42:12.730
What he wants

42:13.010 --> 42:14.640
is just Xiao En.

42:14.660 --> 42:16.660
But Fan Xian doesn't know

42:16.660 --> 42:18.800
where Xiao En is imprisoned.

42:19.420 --> 42:20.530
Do you know why

42:20.530 --> 42:21.950
I detained Xiao En?

42:21.970 --> 42:23.240
No. I don't.

42:23.340 --> 42:25.800
Just for this moment.

42:28.420 --> 42:29.400
Go to

42:29.420 --> 42:31.400
get He Daoren and Langtao here.

42:31.420 --> 42:32.690
Got it.

43:01.200 --> 43:04.780
In the river of history,

43:04.800 --> 43:08.270
time goes round and round.

43:11.080 --> 43:14.420
Memories about the former and present lives

43:14.440 --> 43:18.510
join each other in an endless way.

43:20.400 --> 43:23.020
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:23.040 --> 43:25.280
one season follows another in a flash,

43:25.280 --> 43:27.780
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:27.800 --> 43:29.400
I just can't give up

43:29.400 --> 43:32.740
to be with you for my whole life.

43:32.760 --> 43:38.230
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:39.480 --> 43:42.030
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:42.320 --> 43:44.360
Year after year in the wandering,

43:44.360 --> 43:47.020
I count the remaining years.

43:47.040 --> 43:49.220
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:49.240 --> 43:51.230
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:51.520 --> 43:53.910
I never feel regretful.

43:53.960 --> 43:55.320
In such a chaotic world,

43:55.320 --> 43:58.300
I still miss you as ever.

43:58.320 --> 44:01.270
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:01.560 --> 44:03.620
With a gentle heart,

44:03.640 --> 44:06.300
I cherish our remaining years.

44:06.320 --> 44:07.840
Even though we have to go through

44:07.840 --> 44:10.350
all the hardships along the journey,

44:10.480 --> 44:17.670
you always stay by my side,

44:17.760 --> 44:20.430
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:20.720 --> 44:22.800
Year after year in the wandering,

44:22.800 --> 44:25.460
I count the remaining years.

44:25.480 --> 44:27.620
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:27.640 --> 44:29.870
even though we end up the destiny,

44:30.080 --> 44:32.260
I never feel regretful.

44:32.280 --> 44:33.680
In such a chaotic world,

44:33.680 --> 44:36.740
I still miss you as ever.

44:36.760 --> 44:39.870
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:39.960 --> 44:42.100
With a gentle heart,

44:42.120 --> 44:44.820
I cherish our remaining years.

44:44.840 --> 44:46.280
Even though we have to go through

44:46.280 --> 44:48.940
all the hardships along the journey,

44:48.960 --> 44:57.720
you always stay by my side...
